# Registry allowlist — hostnames `runner` (commands) may reach via the proxy.
# Extended regex, matched against the destination host. Keep this SHORT and curated:
# every host here is also a permitted command-egress destination.
#
# Add your company's internal registry here (centrally, reviewed once) and rebuild the image.

# npm / yarn / pnpm
(^|\.)npmjs\.org$
(^|\.)yarnpkg\.com$
(^|\.)npmjs\.com$

# Python (PyPI)
(^|\.)pypi\.org$
(^|\.)pythonhosted\.org$

# Go modules
(^|\.)golang\.org$
(^|\.)proxy\.golang\.org$
(^|\.)sum\.golang\.org$

# Rust (crates.io)
(^|\.)crates\.io$

# Java / Maven Central
(^|\.)maven\.org$

# Source deps frequently pulled by package managers
(^|\.)github\.com$
(^|\.)githubusercontent\.com$
(^|\.)codeload\.github\.com$

# Toolchain mirrors (Node release downloads, Debian/Ubuntu apt)
(^|\.)nodejs\.org$
(^|\.)debian\.org$
(^|\.)ubuntu\.com$
